        padding: 2px;
        background-color:QLinearGradient( x1: 0, y1: 0, x2: 0, y2: 1, stop: 0 grey, stop: 0.1 #d7d7d7, stop: 0.49 #d6d6d6, stop: 0.5 #d3d3d3, stop: 1 grey);
